  "description": "BlockTicks tick-mapper golden vectors. `expected` values are hand-derived golden pins; the self-test verifies the reference implementation against them, and the generator refuses to emit unless every pin passes. Schedule semantics: an entry {height, tau} sets the interval for blocks > height; genesis itself contributes 0 ticks and always reports the default interval, but an entry at height 0 is valid and sets block 1's interval. TickToHeight rounds down and saturates at MAX_HEIGHT. HeightToTick saturates at MAX_TICK. All integer values are decimal strings to preserve full 64-bit precision.",
